OL,5,G1200 Gary Barlow's Food and Wine Tour:
OL,6,G     New Zealand
OL,7,     FGary and Jason Manford arrive in
OL,8,     FQueenstown, where they take a boat
OL,9,     Fride through the Shotover Canyons
OL,10,     Fat high speed. They head to
OL,11,     FAmisfield Winery, where winemaker
OL,12,     FSam Davies introduces them to
OL,13,     FCentral Otago pinot noir, a robot
OL,14,     Fscarecrow and one of New Zealand's
OL,15,     Fmost renowned kitchens. Their
OL,16,     Fadventure ends on the shores of
OL,17,     FLake Wakatipu, with an extreme
OL,18,     Fcold plunge and a sauna with an
OL,19,     Fexcellent view
