OL,5,G0300 Dermot's Taste of Ireland
OL,6,     FDermot O'Leary's culinary
OL,7,     Fadventure takes him west to
OL,8,     FBallycastle, a former Viking
OL,9,     Fsettlement and a jewel of the
OL,10,     FCauseway Coastal Route. With
OL,11,     FRathlin Island on the horizon, he
OL,12,     Fheads out on a wildlife-watching
OL,13,     Ftrip, and then joins bakers Ciara
OL,14,     Fand Dara, who bake a blueberry pie
OL,15,     Fusing local fruit. Next, Dermot
OL,16,     Fheads inland to Broughgammon Farm,
OL,17,     Fwhere husband-and-wife team
OL,18,     FCharlie and Becky are reshaping
OL,19,     Flocal food culture as they
OL,20,     Fchampion goat meat and rose veal
